### 5. Streaming Resilience - Partial Save & Reconnection

**Area:** Stability - Streaming  
**Priority:** P1 (Critical)  
**Effort:** 8-12h  
**Impact:** 🟡 High - Poprawia UX na niestabilnych sieciach

**Problem:**
- Zerwane połączenia powodują utratę danych
- Brak partial save
- Brak reconnection logic

**Solution:**
```javascript
// Partial save podczas streamingu
let accumulatedContent = '';
for await (const chunk of stream) {
    accumulatedContent += chunk;
    // Save partial content co 1s
    if (Date.now() - lastSave > 1000) {
        await savePartialResponse(conversationId, accumulatedContent);
        lastSave = Date.now();
    }
}

// Reconnection logic
if (connectionLost) {
    const partial = await getPartialResponse(conversationId);
    // Resume stream from partial content
    await resumeStream(conversationId, partial);
}
```

**Deliverables:**
